fn selfhost_memo_trait_operation_method_body_fact_table_builder_producer_error %fn SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyFactProducerErrorKind SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyFactTableBuilderErrorKind \error:
