//: selfhost_memo_trait_operation_method_body_fact_table_builder_stage0: method body fact table builder の smoke API
//:
//: [目的/もくてき]:
//: - pure `Eq` root の 1 件 push、pure `Eq` と ExternalIo `Hash` root の 2 件 push、`Copy` operation rejection、error expression rejection、missing root rejection を小さな HIR module で確認します。
pub fn selfhost_memo_trait_operation_method_body_fact_table_builder_stage0 %impure fn void Result SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyFactTableBuilderStage0Summary StdErrorKind \void:
